      "md": "## A Buffer is bytes\n\n`Buffer.from(\"café\", \"utf8\")` is bytes. `.toString(\"utf8\")` is text again. `.length` on a buffer is byte length, not character count.\n\nPrint the UTF-8 byte length of `café` (`5`)."
